{"id":"wb-5-192","name":"扎滚鲁克古墓群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"扎滚鲁克古墓群","text":"扎滚鲁克古墓群是位于中国新疆维吾尔自治区巴音郭楞蒙古自治州且末县以西10公里的一处古墓群。古墓为方形棚架墓，属家庭丛葬墓，共有男、女、小孩14人，以仰身屈葬为主。随葬有石、陶、木、铜、铁、毛、棉服饰等，距今2700年(春秋战国)，为国家级重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%89%8E%E6%BB%9A%E9%B2%81%E5%85%8B%E5%8F%A4%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":92646841,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92646841","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/54e8ce02fa00c45fc31b54a7.jpg","title":"Zhagunluke_Tombs_Protection_Stele.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Zhagunluke_Tombs_Protection_Stele.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ab/Zhagunluke_Tombs_Protection_Stele.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Prcshaw","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​扎滚鲁克古墓群","width":320,"height":180}}